1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,490
If you raised this shield,

2
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:02,910
someone looking straight at you

3
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:05,040
could watch your body disappear.

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,150
You see, its surface

5
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:08,180
is covered in tiny lenses.

6
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:08,890
They spread the light

7
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,640
coming from your body sideways,

8
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:11,800
while smearing the background

9
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:12,620
across the space

10
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:13,950
where you’re standing.

11
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:15,130
From the right position,

12
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,340
your outline disappears

13
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,470
into a blurred patch of scenery.

14
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:19,720
So you could reach one hand

15
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,890
around the edge…

16
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:21,990
and make it look like a hand

17
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:23,680
is floating in midair.

18
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:25,240
Then lower the shield…

19
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,400
and reveal you were standing

20
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,370
right in front of them

21
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:28,960
the entire time.

